{"schemaVersion":"galpedia-static-detail-model-v1","dataRevision":"a0c0367b8270b080feef0ef1fe65522144dc62343feb9d752729d92867d0d639","workId":"19359","model":{"presentationWorkId":"egs:19359","staff":{"artwork":[],"scenario":[],"music":[],"other":[]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_bangumi_188503","characterName":"さいがくりす","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"188503","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"96671"}]},"originalCharacterName":"さいがくりす","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"由緒ある巫術師の家系の分家に生まれた少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"巫術から引退した両親に溺愛されて育てられるが、その過保護さのおかげで逆にひねくれてしまい、勝手に独学で魔術を取得してしまった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"特技は妖魔召喚魔術で、過去に魔神バエルの召喚・契約に成功している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"今回、魔王リヴァイアサンの召喚を試みるが、その力に負け、妖魔界に逆召喚されてしまう。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"188503"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2f/2f1f3a7247a92fd18bcf9240b3f5d4d4a12a4849f1cf5102379b06cf9964dc65.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f2/f285d5f0a807cf2bbbbd98fb0ab2937e18eed19c20e11a005da76bab41207a61.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_188504","characterName":"ベル","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"188504","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"96671"}]},"originalCharacterName":"ベル","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"クリスの召喚した最○の使い魔、魔神バエルの普段の姿。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"魔界に逆召喚された際、リヴィアとの戦いで魔神の姿に戻れなくなってしまっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その性格は天然で人懐っこく、力を失った今では単なる喋るペットでしかない。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"188504"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/33/332ebb18e05a53bdbea5c6a7f0877b7d0ddb87f6d237779223e4c67708e49a70.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b8/b8b65311ec39420e129fdfcc0b48d8fb4192bcd624e10783ebc0a905cc58ca8b.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_188505","characterName":"アンナ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"188505","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"96671"}]},"originalCharacterName":"アンナ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"倒れていたクリスを介抱し、自分の所有する宿屋の一室に住まわせてくれた謎の妖魔。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"事あるごとにクリスにセクハラまがいの言動をするが、それと同時に彼女たちが元の世界に戻れるように様々な助言をする。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"188505"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6d/6d56bc9603e8d8ecb5585e31ee73bbccfc9be8f522eb96493633f694cfea8981.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/31/3135f490d5a980ce46831fac21dd64c96b55a7f2b6b33dd90a0015f836eb0b86.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_188506","characterName":"リヴィア","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"188506","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"96671"}]},"originalCharacterName":"リヴィア","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"クリスが召喚を試みた魔王。異名はリヴァイアサン。"